  },
  {
    "series_name_us": "XY–Phantom Forces",
    "release_date_us": "It brings 122 new cards to the card game, including a new mechanic called \"Spirit Link\" that allows Mega Pokémon to evolve without ending the player's turn. It also introduces six new Pokémon-EX cards, and two new Mega Evolutions to the game.The card \"Lysandre's Trump Card\" (numbered 99/119 and 118/119), was banned from all sanctioned Pokémon Organized Play events from June 15, 2015, onward.This set also released the only silver Pokémon card to every be printed in a main set, Dialga EX.",
    "era": "Sixth Generation Sets",
    "type": "Table-based"
