    "series_name_us": "Detective Pikachu",
    "release_date_us": "Detective Pikachuis the third special expansion released on March 29, 2019. The booster packs were sold as part of special collection boxes. The set features 18 cards with artwork and attacks based on thePokémon: Detective Pikachufilm. Many cards from the set were also distributed with a foil stamp if you bought a ticket to the movie.",
