  {
    "series_name_us": "Pokémon GO",
    "release_date_us": "Pokémon GOis the fourth special expansion set in the Sword & Shield series, and was released on July 1, 2022. Pokémon GO contains 78 cards in the main set, including 3 Radiant Pokémon, 13 Pokémon V cards, 2 Pokémon VMAX cards, 5 Pokémon VSTAR (some of those being alternate art cards). Pokémon GO is based on the incredibly popular mobile game of the same name.",
